Welcome to  Riff Music!
Riff is a open-source audio/video aggregator / streaming platform powered by Youtube (YTDL), Spotify and more.
riff/riff contains sources for the main backend written in Go.
riff/client contains sources for frontend code written in Flutter, this runs across IOS, Web and Android targets.
riff/recd is a upcoming recommendation service were introducing inside Riff.


Riff is a spiritual successor to Kabeer's Music (Better known as Yebr Music) and implements a lot of the same features but learns from its mistakes.

We are planning to add our own custom residential proxies via Android Phones and ESP-Like microcontrollers connecting via reverse shell acting as a Layer-4 proxy.
We would be delighted to see and open for contribution

Regards,
Kabeer

